{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Raw Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../message-report-option/", "title": "MessageReportOption"}, "next": {"link": "../message-views/", "title": "MessageViews"}, "title": "MessageService", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"messageservice\">\n<h1>MessageService<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#messageservice\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.raw.types.MessageService\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.raw.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">MessageService</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.raw.types.MessageService\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Telegram API type.</p>\n<p>Constructor of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/message/#pyrogram.raw.base.Message\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.Message\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Message</span></code></a>.</p>\n<dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>Details:</dt><dd><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>Layer: <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">222</span></code></p></li>\n<li><p>ID: <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">7A800E0A</span></code></p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code> <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">32-bit</span></code>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>peer_id</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/peer/#pyrogram.raw.base.Peer\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.Peer\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Peer</span></code></a>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>date</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code> <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">32-bit</span></code>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>action</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/message-action/#pyrogram.raw.base.MessageAction\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.MessageAction\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MessageAction</span></code></a>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>out</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>mentioned</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>media_unread</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>reactions_are_possible</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>silent</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>post</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>legacy</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>from_id</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/peer/#pyrogram.raw.base.Peer\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.Peer\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Peer</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>saved_peer_id</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/peer/#pyrogram.raw.base.Peer\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.Peer\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Peer</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>reply_to</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/message-reply-header/#pyrogram.raw.base.MessageReplyHeader\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.MessageReplyHeader\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MessageReplyHeader</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>reactions</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/message-reactions/#pyrogram.raw.base.MessageReactions\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.MessageReactions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MessageReactions</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>ttl_period</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code> <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">32-bit</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["telegram/types/message-views", "MessageViews", "N", "next"], ["telegram/types/message-report-option", "MessageReportOption", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">MessageService</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.raw.types.MessageService\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MessageService</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_